{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30243","headline":"醉中闻甘州 · 薛逢","name":"醉中闻甘州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老听笙歌亦解愁，醉中因遣合甘州。\n行追赤岭千山外，坐想黄河一曲流。\n日暮岂堪征妇怨，路傍能结旅人愁。\n左绵刺史心先死，泪满朱弦催白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}